{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":405344,\"title\":\"The Nightwatch\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Dark and brooding thriller. A group of mercenaries are assembled in Amsterdam by a British intelligence officer. Believing they are awaiting the details of a new mission, they decide to spend their free time in the sleazy bars and brothels. Over the course of the weekend it gradually becomes clear that all is not what it seems. Unknown to them their paths have all crossed before, and the deceit and violence of the past is about to become their own downfall.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zoUghfYlx0cq4mUQ4Q53oREg5Hd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":1989,\"runtime\":50,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Danny Boyle\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2034,\"name\":\"Danny Boyle\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b5qQpFHmgNyvV1t81ou17Jt2fRj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1219757,\"name\":\"Leslie Grantham\",\"character\":\"David Smallman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e9mBdIni2QJIviyNY6XDwBMkWnH.jpg\"},{\"id\":26259,\"name\":\"Michael Feast\",\"character\":\"Philip Howard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uktan01EPcRkFgmZz3dklN9bhQD.jpg\"},{\"id\":73284,\"name\":\"Tony Doyle\",\"character\":\"John Healey\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7OuYHRAqtL0hBIewcshEibOAH8c.jpg\"},{\"id\":2467,\"name\":\"James Cosmo\",\"character\":\"James Smithson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4QZnZ3wyGALVuwZ70HdXZk4O14W.jpg\"},{\"id\":662,\"name\":\"Don Fellows\",\"character\":\"Paul Arland\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2HFUZr73tp5BSOs02Ev7pGoDUfE.jpg\"},{\"id\":117896,\"name\":\"Joop Doderer\",\"character\":\"Van Heligan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AtBKprKaH45KToGUDqcDBOeKAu9.jpg\"},{\"id\":56552,\"name\":\"Sean Chapman\",\"character\":\"Frank Smallman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iAuP9HCstZE71p3Ipl5moe8kxgo.jpg\"},{\"id\":101023,\"name\":\"Fintan McKeown\",\"character\":\"Ranger O'Byrne\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dcO3OyEHlXmBrpYamIquRZtsgAL.jpg\"},{\"id\":3143916,\"name\":\"Fran Brennan\",\"character\":\"Ranger Joe\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1239719,\"name\":\"Noel Magee\",\"character\":\"Lt. Ranger\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1951247,\"name\":\"Tom McCabe\",\"character\":\"CID Man\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2985176,\"name\":\"Gerry Sullivan\",\"character\":\"Duty Sergeant\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2114255,\"name\":\"George Mooney\",\"character\":\"Sergeant\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1098200,\"name\":\"Inge Ipenburg\",\"character\":\"Girl\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xrig1OI4wESsPUi4tqVm9TE6ewU.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":801335,\"title\":\"Girl in the Basement\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tPP9n6r5QrIKPnshnJqE7klptj2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDR2h5uQNgWyx3fsEVnEOcNFibZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sara is a teen girl who is looking forward to her 18th birthday to move away from her controlling father Don. But before she could even blow out the candles, Don imprisons her in the basement of their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1149167,\"title\":\"High Rollers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hHowAaChDjwueySmwVbsjHmpWa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsRtpoXBKWVe8B3qh3nqEjdq2Zj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A master thief must pull off a dangerous casino heist when his nemesis kidnaps his lover. Caught between rival criminals and FBI pursuit, he risks all to save her and score big.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":451156,\"title\":\"Infidelity in Suburbia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gKyvJ8u2US61pHR56C2DoVbwnu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjnewOLmAYEfh1jeoXme7FO77K2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With her husband away at work, and her son at school, Laura dreams of a home-renovation project to supplant her restless days. Elliott, her irresistibly hot private contractor, soon fulfills her more forbidden dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":379170,\"title\":\"Sherlock: The Abominable Bride\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hibE8cyZs2Bm0o4WaWd1pppvjO2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGeoc8rFfPRIakXNttoFU85YVwv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson find themselves in 1890s London in this holiday special.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1116490,\"title\":\"Cash Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v3youHDLigrtIis1NqTjlY8Sk38.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6VoxDupaW2VXfLtJyeOoGCgXSjD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Criminal mastermind Mason is about to execute the score of a lifetime when his lover and key member of his crew, Decker, takes the team down and reveals she’s an undercover Interpol agent. Heartbroken, Mason escapes and retires from the life of crime until his younger brother Shawn is out of his league taking on a big bank heist all on his own. Mason has no choice left but to come to the rescue, while Interpol brings Decker in hoping to unnerve him. Before the SWAT teams storm the bank, Mason must use every tool in his arsenal to not only escape with the prize, but also the love of his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":375846,\"title\":\"Bad Sister\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hlJSkTnCZsotjOJjAA5jrdckH0o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Sh04np6IA2shSycI9uy5xrjC6I.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a top student at St. Adeline's Catholic Boarding School, Zoe senses that something is not quite right about the school's new nun-- a sense proven to be true when it is revealed the \\\"good' nun is an imposter with a fatal attraction to Zoe's brother.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7342,\"title\":\"Carrie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/30wtkJVv6Zjl3joUX7tmrgGJVBZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8z5qtVE2N3AuA3bmvIQsI10Wjg8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl's lonely life is dominated by relentless bullying at school and an oppressive religious fanatic mother at home. When her tormentors pull a humiliating prank at the senior prom, she unleashes a horrifying chaos on everyone, leaving nothing but destruction in her wake.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"TV Movie\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336004,\"title\":\"Heist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eKdz5i9gbzJthAxUZBBj5SVbzKR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/py92vTBXC2lpFXWvrvlDE9b6gU4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A father is without the means to pay for his daughter's medical treatment. As a last resort, he partners with a greedy co-worker to rob a casino. When things go awry they're forced to hijack a city bus.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":19543,\"title\":\"Anacondas: Trail of Blood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/916jenbMstGCE20hceYDTo8psf4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zzJxwLTX5QCWkWsq7RnRhNKFBBo.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A genetically created Anaconda, cut in half, regenerates itself into two new aggressive giant snakes, due to the Blood Orchid.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":989473,\"title\":\"Invitation to a Murder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ucYuml5QqkcGKmWmJj7JpJdsPc1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hu2K1XlEyRjO2JvzIHBa6cPQRAi.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A reclusive billionaire invites six seemingly random strangers to his island estate in the south of England. Aspiring detective Miranda Green finds the mysterious invitation too alluring to pass up. When another guest turns up dead, Miranda must get to the bottom of the malicious plot behind the gathering.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14863,\"title\":\"Anaconda 3: Offspring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3PI6dXS0UlNlB6IXnngfEtufFxm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmB5vs4KqJdo767gncUrS9vAsRz.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mercenary-for-hire accepts a mission from a billionaire to capture a dangerous snake that could possibly help cure a terminal illness.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075334,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7SkhcQYU8mxGGCbmRbqOf6UFIuE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ITBddEttA7Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"